==Battleground==
*8 [[Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*8 [[Snache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 8.33~14.67 seconds<sup>250f~440f</sup>.
*8 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Yuki (Enemy)|Yuki]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

